
flowchart TB
    U[ERP User] --> FE[React + TypeScript Frontend]

    FE -->|HTTP / JSON| API[Express REST API]

    API --> MW[Middleware]
    MW --> CTRL[Controllers]
    CTRL --> SVC[Services]
    SVC --> ORM[Prisma ORM]
    ORM --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    API --> AUTH[JWT Authentication]
    API --> VALID[Zod Validation]

    DB --> USERS[Users and Roles]
    DB --> INV[Inventory]
    DB --> STOCK[Stock Balances and Movements]
    DB --> AUDIT[Audit Logs]
